# Run artifacts. Holds live production session cookies, screenshots and the
# preserve-tier backup (which contains the encrypted siteSettings credentials).
# Never commit this.
/.tester-runs/

# Harness-only secrets: the test mailbox the email cases read.
#
# 🛑 This rule exists BEFORE the file does, deliberately. The credential lives here
# rather than in the consumer's .env.local because the app only ever SENDS mail
# (resend) and never reads it — a live mailbox password has no business in the env
# the Vercel build sees. But `tester/` is a submodule that ships via pointer bumps,
# so an un-ignored .env here is one `git add -A` away from being published.
/.env
/.env.local

node_modules/
